</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, remove my veil;</l><l>Let my mind be renewed.</l><l>Cast away evil thoughts in my head, Lord.</l><l>Fill me with Spirit full.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, remove my veil;</l><l>Let me dearly behold You.</l><l>Burn away any thorn in my heart, Lord,</l><l>With Your love sweet and true.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, remove my veil;</l><l>Make me deeply in love with You.</l><l>Nothing else I desire but Your presence;</l><l>Let me remain here with You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
